# 1. PRODUCT OBJECTIVE

The purpose of this capability group is to help organizations:

> **Track vendor PQC readiness, standards alignment, contractual obligations, evidence requests, ecosystem dependencies, trust-chain exposure, and hybrid cryptographic migration compatibility.**

The experience must be:

* Enterprise-grade
* Professional
* Simple
* Evidence-driven
* Operational
* Easy to understand
* Technically credible
* Production-ready

Do NOT turn these pages into generic cybersecurity dashboards.

Do NOT overload the user with unnecessary charts.

Each page must have one dominant job.

